  data: {
    LLM: 'Flush pursuit is more valuable than in standard 52-card poker because flushes are rarer in the 32-card deck.\n\nUnderstand stripped-deck probabilities: straights and flushes are more common, while full houses are slightly less frequent than in a full deck.\n\nTrack suit distribution to leverage the suit ranking tiebreaker; avoid drawing into easily dominated flushes when opponents likely hold higher suits.',
    Player: 'Flush pursuit is more valuable than in standard 52-card poker because flushes are rarer in the 32-card deck.\n\nUnderstand stripped-deck probabilities: straights and flushes are more common, while full houses are slightly less frequent than in a full deck.\n\nTrack suit distribution to leverage the suit ranking tiebreaker; avoid drawing into easily dominated flushes when opponents likely hold higher suits.',
